      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Clean Up Voice (Inworld Voice Isolator)\n\nSeparates the voice in a recording from noise, music and room sound. The\nvoice keeps its level and timing; the second output is what was removed, and\nthe two add up to the input. Use it on a reference voice before cloning\n(Chatterbox, Audio8, Qwen3-TTS) or on speech before subtitles.\n\nInworld Voice Isolator v1, the offline model: 64M parameters, 48 kHz,\nApache-2.0 for code and weights. The Voice Isolator node is part of this\ntemplate pack and runs the `inworld-voice-isolation` package; it downloads\n`denoiser.safetensors` (0.26 GB) from inworld/voice-isolator into\n`models/voice_isolator/` on first use. Profile `voice-isolator`. The sample is\nInworld's `sample_14.wav`.\n"
      ]
    }
